### PhoneMail API: try it from GoLand / VS Code (REST Client). Cookies are kept between requests.
@base = http://localhost:3000

### What login screen to show
GET {{base}}/api/auth/config

### 1a. OTP mode: ask for a code (AUTH_MODE=console prints it in `docker compose logs api`)
POST {{base}}/api/auth/otp/start
Content-Type: application/json
X-Requested-With: fetch

{"phone": "9876500001"}

### 1b. ...then log in with it
POST {{base}}/api/auth/otp/verify
Content-Type: application/json
X-Requested-With: fetch

{"phone": "9876500001", "code": "053962", "client": "web"}

### 1c. Password mode instead: register, then log in
POST {{base}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
X-Requested-With: fetch

{"phone": "9876500001", "password": "change me please"}

###
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-Requested-With: fetch

{"phone": "9876500001", "password": "change me please"}

### Who am I?
GET {{base}}/api/me

### Change name and language
PATCH {{base}}/api/me
Content-Type: application/json
X-Requested-With: fetch

{"display_name": "Kavya", "language": "en"}

### Add an alias
POST {{base}}/api/me/aliases
Content-Type: application/json
X-Requested-With: fetch

{"alias": "kavya.rao"}

### Home (goes to the mail service's GET /conversations)
GET {{base}}/api/mail/conversations?filter=all

### Send a mail
POST {{base}}/api/mail/messages
Content-Type: application/json
X-Requested-With: fetch

{"to": {"address": "9876500002"}, "subject": "Hello", "body_text": "Sent through the Node API"}

### Live events (leave it open; send a mail from another account)
GET {{base}}/api/events

### Health
GET {{base}}/api/health

### Log out
POST {{base}}/api/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json
X-Requested-With: fetch

{}
